# Optional. Enables the "IA en vivo" plug (Gemini 2.5 Flash) in the browser.
# Without it, Avista runs fully offline with the deterministic local E-1 engine.
# WARNING: any VITE_* variable is bundled into the client JavaScript. Use only a
# restricted demo key here; production AI goes through the FastAPI backend
# (Amazon Bedrock), which keeps credentials server-side.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=""
